  <bpmn:process id="currency-conversion" name="Currency Conversion" isExecutable="true" operaton:historyTimeToLive="P30D">
    <bpmn:documentation>Demonstrates the operaton:connector mechanism: calling a REST endpoint without a Java delegate using the built-in HTTP connector, and registering a custom Connector SPI implementation.

